[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 492.23, "timestamp": "00:08:12", "text": "第二點是什麼嗎？一秒鐘。一秒鐘。看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 499.35, "timestamp": "00:08:19", "text": "好的。我們試試看。我們試試看。我們試試看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 500.95, "timestamp": "00:08:20", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 504.469, "timestamp": "00:08:24", "text": "呃，稅務員是什麼？我想我得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 507.27, "timestamp": "00:08:27", "text": "負責這件事，對吧？我在這場遊戲中得了12分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 510.71, "timestamp": "00:08:30", "text": "哇。好的。那麼，這個美元符號手勢是什麼意思呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 512.31, "timestamp": "00:08:32", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 514.389, "timestamp": "00:08:34", "text": "如何推動？你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 515.99, "timestamp": "00:08:35", "text": "從那裡拿著卡片，然後把它推來推去。就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 517.829, "timestamp": "00:08:37", "text": "拿著它，像這樣移動它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 520.07, "timestamp": "00:08:40", "text": "如何才能控制住這個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 522.87, "timestamp": "00:08:42", "text": "孩子並擺脫他？按一下滑鼠左鍵。按一下滑鼠左鍵。哦，左鍵"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 526.43, "timestamp": "00:08:46", "text": "點擊。是的。嘿，給你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 530.15, "timestamp": "00:08:50", "text": "好的。好的，過來。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 531.75, "timestamp": "00:08:51", "text": "呃，你應該仔細檢查每個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 534.71, "timestamp": "00:08:54", "text": "角落和縫隙，看看在哪裡。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 535.79, "timestamp": "00:08:55", "text": "當"}]